+Between the stop signal and the release, the old gateway still answers
+everything else it would not serve with `503` (a WebSocket with close `1013`).
+Set `gateway.restart_listener_hold_seconds` (for example `60`) together with
+the relay to hold such a request instead, up to that many seconds: once the
+profile is released it is forwarded to the next gateway, and its answer comes
+back on the same connection. With the key the old gateway also serves every
+`GET` while its stores are open, and a Webapp WebSocket opened before the
+restart wait stays open through it.
+
